{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"缅甸","country_iso":"MMR","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:49:40.438044","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"MMR-PV-0007","ldc":"Yes","location":"仰光东部达贡工业区","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"缅甸仰光30MW光伏项目","project_name_en":"Myanmar Yangon 30MW Solar PV Project","subcategory":"光储"},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"","content":"缅甸GOOD BROTHERS’CO.,LTD与昆自海外电力发展有限公司正式签署合作协议，将在仰光东部达贡工业区（East Dagon Industrial Zone）携手开发一座规模达30兆瓦（含6MWh储能），分三期开发的光伏电站。\n该项目选址于一片约80英亩（约合486亩）的优质土地上，预计将分三期稳步推进建设。双方将充分发挥各自在资源整合、技术研发、工程实施及本地运营方面的核心优势，强强联合，形成坚实可靠的协作纽带，共同驱动项目从蓝图走向现实，确保每一期工程都扎实落地。\n此次合作不仅是双方在绿色能源领域迈出的战略性一步，更是中缅企业携手践行可持续发展理念的生动实践。项目建成后，每年将为工业区及周边稳定输送大量清洁电力，显著优化当地能源结构，为仰光乃至缅甸的产业发展注入强劲的“绿色动能”。\n这一协议的签署，标志着在“一带一路”合作框架下，中缅企业正以清洁能源为笔，共同擘画互利共赢、低碳发展的新图景，为区域繁荣增添了一抹鲜明的绿色印记。","content_sha256":"f9aa0a20590cd0e4af1e1a8f53ee2ebc8946292f97ac22fd40c5a5c134729278","id":3097,"publish_date":"2025-06-24 17:57:04","title":"缅甸好兄弟公司与昆自海外电力发展有限公司签约","title_sha256":"91e09506cd9b96f4eac2cba776e357234484991781d62cb9157e72b474f63729","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/84384.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"MMR-PV-0007","capacity_details":"PV: 30MW, BESS: 6MWh","capacity_mw":30.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"30","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:49:40.438237","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"MMR-PV-0007-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://www.seetao.com/details/246560.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"缅甸GOOD BROTHERS’CO.,LTD;昆自海外电力发展有限公司","project_develope